# mine - Area 3 drifting space mine (hazard: shoot it, don't touch it). 12x12, 2 frames, straight top-down,
# radially symmetric (no facing; safe to rotate). light: top-left. K exterior outline; four diagonal contact
# horns (an X) pierce the outline, unlike the sentry's + spikes.
# Palette: steel 1 2 3 4 5, fire f o O y, K (10 colours). Dark steel shell, lit top-left, shaded bottom-right.
# Accent: thruster-orange beacon 2x2 at pixels (5,5)-(6,6) inside a K socket. Orange, not red (the sentry's
# core), gold (pickup shells) or cyan (player). Smallest must-read feature: the 2x2 beacon.
# Frames: 0 dim (beacon o over f) 333 ms, 1 flash (beacon y/O) 167 ms, loop. Only the 4 beacon pixels change.
# Anchor: frame centre (6,6). In a field, offset each mine's blink phase so the group twinkles, not strobes.
